2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]statistics_tab_accuracy_round_two.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/statistics_tab_accuracy_round_two.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-oo[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-oo/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Correct the Rust statistics counters and expose breakdown [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]truncation[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]core-counters[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-counters: in ../sase-core, make `committing_agents` count distinct [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]agent names and add `committing_runs`, stop counting a missing archive [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]project spec as malformed, scope `user_hidden_skipped` to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]runner-eligible rows, add per-row xprompt breakdown truncation counts, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bump the wire schema, and update the pinned version in this repo's core [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]validator.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop asserting zero samples and meaningless shares in Perf [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]latency rows[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]perf-latency[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]perf-latency: make the By Subsystem Count column render an unknown count[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]as an em dash instead of 0, remove the incommensurable Share denominator[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]for that grouping, and define the Launch hero tile's statistic in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Perf legend.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make the All time window and empty-window states honest[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]range-window[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]range-window: replace the epoch-derived All time absolute label, clamp [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the Overview runs-over-time buckets to the observed data instead of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]emitting one row per day since 1970, and stop the run-count empty state [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]from hiding log-backed Activity and Plans & Questions data.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Render the corrected core counters and disclose XPrompt [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]truncation[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]consume-core[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-counters[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]consume-core: read the new wire fields so the Overview commits tile [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stops labelling runs as agents, correct the Projects malformed-file [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]footnote and the stale Specs column, disclose the XPrompts breakdown [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]truncation, split the XPrompts Share legend by denominator, and refresh [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the affected PNG goldens.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-oo","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-oo.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-942edaa02ee82c471ec52568c138a45f","started_at":"2026-08-17T16:02:55.197409+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1786984272,"sha":"56dbeb2f6d9715dc6710eb4ba0e78c9dc408fd0b","subject":"fix(stats): make All time window and empty-window states honest"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":